he plot. Your choices will determine your fate and also affect the future of Taoyuan Village.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivator Protection:</strong> Taoyuan Village is protected by cultivators, filled with mystery and ancient traditions. Here, you will learn various cultivation knowledge and enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Female Character Interaction:</strong> Each female character has a unique personality and background story. Interacting with them will bring you rich emotional experiences. Increasing favorability not only grants rewards but also unlocks more storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Farming Experience:</strong> The farming system in the game realistically simulates the processes of planting, watering, and harvesting, allowing you to truly feel the joy and sense of achievement of farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pleasure of Water Area Exploration:</strong> The vast and mysterious water areas on the map hide new fish and treasures with every exploration. Fishing is not only a leisurely activity but also a challenge and adventure.</p></li></ul>",
